      "title": "1 Method details",
      "instruction": "Herewith we present a set of MATLAB® / GNU Octave© scripts and their mathematical description. These are designed to calculate the surface erosion rates using one or more measured cosmogenic concentrations at or below the surface when the bulk density profile is known. An example of this model's application is described in [4].",
